What would people think of a new tool: trap kits?  I.e., when you apply them,
you create a trap at that place.  Perhaps probability of success could be a
function of your various levels; maybe some would require other ingredients
(e.g. sleeping gas trap requires potion of paralysis) or actions (e.g. you 
first dig a pit or trapdoor, then apply the kit to `hide' it).

It'd be awfully nice if, say, a shopkeeper were tailgating you..  To balance,
maybe they'd be expensive, heavy, hard to use, and perhaps smart monsters
could use them too (heh, heh.)

If people are interested, maybe I'll code it in my copious :-) spare time..

